1
00:00:00,969 --> 00:00:04,929
(Leonard:)...standing before a pool of melted snowmen.
There are carrots and coal in the water.

2
00:00:05,107 --> 00:00:08,507
Do we know what happened to the top hats
and the corncob pipes?

3
00:00:08,677 --> 00:00:12,117
- You see those too.
- Oh, it's like I'm really there.

4
00:00:14,683 --> 00:00:17,883
(Stuart:)I gotta tell you,
this is the most holiday fun I've had...

5
00:00:18,053 --> 00:00:20,993
(Stuart:)...since my therapist
changed my anxiety medication...

6
00:00:21,156 --> 00:00:23,786
(Stuart:)...and I stopped caring about the blood
in my stool.

7
00:00:27,329 --> 00:00:29,259
(Howard:)Good story.

8
00:00:29,765 --> 00:00:33,635
- What're you drinking there? Little eggnog?
- Yes. Is there a problem?

9
00:00:33,802 --> 00:00:38,362
(Leonard:)No, it's nice to see you enjoying
a holiday beverage. Pretty Christmasy.

10
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,570
(Sheldon:)Since when is eggnog a Christmas drink?

11
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:46,780
Eggs are available all year round.
I've been known to enjoy this poolside.

12
00:00:47,216 --> 00:00:50,186
(Leonard:)Come on, Sheldon.
You know all the Christmas stories...

13
00:00:50,352 --> 00:00:53,382
(Leonard:)...and the carols, you've got
an eggnog mustache going on there.

14
00:00:53,555 --> 00:00:56,255
(Leonard:)Just admit it,
you're getting a little yuletide spirit.

15
00:00:56,425 --> 00:01:01,025
(Sheldon:)Don't be silly. Christmas is a bunch of
baloney created by the tinsel industry.

